48
00:03:14.099 --> 00:03:15.797
♪ Come, come, my baby come ♪

49
00:03:15.799 --> 00:03:18.930
♪ I will cover
Your nightmares ♪

50
00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:20.429
♪ Come, come, my baby come ♪

51
00:03:20.431 --> 00:03:23.595
♪ I will love you forever ♪

52
00:03:23.597 --> 00:03:25.264
♪ Come, come, my baby come ♪

53
00:03:25.266 --> 00:03:28.263
♪ I will not let you go
Oh, oh, oh ♪

54
00:03:28.265 --> 00:03:33.197
♪ My soul is in Africa,
With you, boy ♪

55
00:03:33.199 --> 00:03:38.097
♪ Looking on
