59
00:03:43.232 --> 00:03:44.663
♪ Come, come, my baby come ♪

60
00:03:44.665 --> 00:03:47.595
♪ I will cover
Your nightmares ♪

61
00:03:47.597 --> 00:03:49.264
♪ Come, come, my baby come ♪

62
00:03:49.266 --> 00:03:52.133
♪ I will not let you go
Oh, oh, oh ♪

63
00:03:57.765 --> 00:03:59.529
- [Lester] Lester Barnes.
- Natasha Kingsley.

64
00:03:59.531 --> 00:04:02.030
I... I set up
the InfoPass appointment

65
00:04:02.032 --> 00:04:03.395
