and looking official.

144
00:08:07.765 --> 00:08:11.863
She never thought she could
fall for such a romantic.

145
00:08:11.865 --> 00:08:15.597
But he was always reaching
for the stars.

146
00:08:15.599 --> 00:08:18.499
Even if he had to fight
to reach them.

147
00:08:30.932 --> 00:08:33.430
[speaking Korean]

148
00:08:33.432 --> 00:08:35.299
[soft music playing on stereo]

149
00:08:40.997 --> 00:08:45.398
♪ Feels like
I've been here before ♪

150
00:08:47.564 --> 00:08:52.295
♪ Old things don't seem
Same no more ♪

151
00:08:52.297 --> 00:08:53.498
[sighs]

152
00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:11.231
Deus ex machina.

153
00:09:13.364 --> 00:09:15.063
[sighs]

154
00:09:15.065 --> 00:09:17.462
♪ I've been thinking about
What's gone wrong ♪

155
00:09:17.464 --> 00:09:19.495
[Min Soo speaking Korean]

156
00:09:19.497 --> 00:09:24.398
♪ I've been searching
For miles and miles ♪

157
00:09:25.999 --> 00:09:29.532
♪ Looking for someone
To walk with me ♪

158
00:09:38.464 --> 00:09:40.831
- ♪ Walk with me ♪
- ♪ Walk ♪

159
00:09:42.831 --> 00:09:44.331
♪ Walk ♪

160
00:09:47.898 --> 00:09:49.231
♪ Walk ♪

161
00:09:54.231 --> 00:09:55.798
[speaking Korean]

162
00:09:59.498 --> 00:10:00.699
[sighs] Daniel!

163
00:10:14.865 --> 00:10:16.328
[in English]
I wanna help save lives

164
00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.395
and make the world
a better place.

165
00:10:17.397 --> 00:10:20.198
Daniel! [speaks Korean]

166
00:10:21.732 --> 00:10:22.930
Okay, Umma.

167
00:10:22.932 --> 00:10:25.295
[in English]
Today is so important, Daniel.

168
00:10:25.297 --> 00:10:28.198
It's the ticket
to the rest of your life.

169
00:10:31.931 --> 00:10:34.064
I know, Umma.

170
00:10:34.066 --> 00:10:36.265
[Charles] Lookin' like the one
percent, little brother.

171
00:10:37.265 --> 00:10:39.795
Dartmouth
is a very good school.

172
00:10:39.797 --> 00:10:41.730
Very good.

173
00:10:41.732 --> 00:10:43.965
- Good morning. [chuckles]
- [Min Soo] Mmm.

174
00:10:45.998 --> 00:10:47.930
[speaking Korean]

175
00:10:47.932 --> 00:10:49.196
[in English] What?
I don't understand

176
00:10:49.198 --> 00:10:50.399
what you're saying, Mom.

177
00:10:51.832 --> 00:10:53.228
[speaks Korean]

178
00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:54.529
[Daniel] Hmm.

179
00:10:54.531 --> 00:10:57.029
[in English] Man, Dartmouth.

180
00:10:57.031 --> 00:10:58.298
[Daniel] Dartmouth.

181
00:10:59.364 --> 00:11:01.562
Good luck
on your big interview. Huh?

182
00:11:01.564 --> 00:11:03.195
It's all on you now,
Danny boy.

183
00:11:03.197 --> 00:11:04.898
- [laughs]
- [Min Soo clicks tongue]

184
00:11:06.031 --> 00:11:07.231
[speaks Korean]

185
00:11:16.465 --> 00:11:18.799
[in English]
One percent of what?

186
00:11:20.231 --> 00:11:21.997
[door slams shut]

187
00:11:21.999 --> 00:11:25.499
[sighs] Charlie forgot
deposit slip again.

188
00:11:26.063 --> 00:11:27.730
Charlie?

189
00:11:27.732 --> 00:11:28.697
It's okay, Umma.

190
00:11:28.699 --> 00:11:30.930
I'll take it to him and Appa.

191
00:11:30.932 --> 00:11:32.228
After your interview.

192
00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:33.897
Then, straight to school.

193
00:11:33.899 --> 00:11:35.329
- No friends.
- I won't.

194
00:11:35.331 --> 00:11:37.199
Do not be late.

195
00:11:42.364 --> 00:11:44.565
[upbeat reggae music playing]

196
00:12:29.898 --> 00:12:31.799
